namespace WebRecomp.Web.Services.Engine30;

/// <summary>
/// Engine 3.0 descriptive workout preset catalog.
///
/// IMPORTANT TAXONOMY:
///
/// Workout selection is a USER-FACING PRESET.
/// Underneath the preset, Engine 3.0 keeps separate physiological dimensions:
///
///     Workout family
///     + modality
///     + training pattern
///     + session structure
///     + default planned RPE
///
/// This prevents concepts such as "Zone 2" and "Cycling" from being treated
/// as if they were mutually exclusive physiological categories.
///
/// Example:
///
///     ZONE2_CARDIO
///         Family: CARDIO
///         Default modality: GENERAL_CARDIO
///         Pattern: ZONE2
///         Default RPE: 3
///
/// A future UI can therefore keep the simple Zone 2 preset while allowing
/// the user to identify the actual modality as cycling, rowing, treadmill,
/// elliptical, etc.
///
/// No workout preset defines fixed calories or fixed glycogen.
/// </summary>

